The Kerneyy Prison Outpost is an infamous work camp used by the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] to hold dangerous individuals. The outpost is known for terribly harsh working conditions. It's also one of the most well-guarded locations in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]], with zero successful escapes.
